* Original SPIKE import fixture. Supplied values are illustrative, not device data.
.param reference_scale=1
.subckt RC_STAGE in out ref params: r=1k
+ c=1n
R1 in out {r*reference_scale}
C1 out ref {c}
.ends RC_STAGE

.subckt TWO_STAGE in out ref params: r=2k c=2n
Xfirst in middle ref RC_STAGE r={r} c={c}
Xsecond middle out ref RC_STAGE r={r} c={c}
.ends TWO_STAGE
